Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had were about to\Ncollapse Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,cut through the wind and make A stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let the darkness\Nwin, just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone,\Nwe'll go where we all want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you before you\Neven have a chance to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu, splendid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's join the Straw Hats\Nand take out the big guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't our place to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fighting the lead performers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We must keep both our enemies and\Nour allies away from the battle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're saying don't get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of the red line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing up there is Marie Joie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you to be\Nsuperstitious. What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you drunk or something, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing worth\Nseeing up in Marie Joie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of stuck-up\Ncelestial dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're no gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about\Nthe world we know today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the way things were\Nin the ancient past, long before Marco,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,before the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They say there was a land of\Ngods up there, lost to the ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.52,0:04:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever told you that was\Neither crazy or playing a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like a fairy tale, but\Nthis world is full of strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stop daydreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a fight right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was waiting for you to rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Izo, do you believe in God?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound like Pops when he was drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, wake up, you're rookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys better check yourselves\Nbefore you wreck yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, nothing you've\Nthrown at us has done a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you what they call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Drought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And Plague!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the three calamities\Nthat protect Commander Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're called the lead performers\Nbecause we always take center stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to describe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but ever since I took off that stupid\Nraid suit, my body has felt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not drag me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I felt sick, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just feels kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, weird, like your eyebrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I said my body, you jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridal grabber!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't owe you shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard all of Judge's kids are cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of you is artificial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Judge is as crazy as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet he got real creative with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is that burning\Nleg of yours a machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you, pal, but\Nunlike my siblings, I'm 100 % human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans can't light themselves\Non fire, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know damn well\Nyou're not a Lunarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My passion is hotter than fire, so you\Nbetter believe I can bring the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cook sea monsters with this leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cook a dinosaur, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you cyborg technology\Nthat even Vegapot can't touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoy the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pay attention, you big-ass mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of blade is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a swordsman,\Nyou're a killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you I don't need formal\Nstyle to cut someone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No good point you never called yourself\Na swordsman in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way who\Nknows how this will go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,By the end of this fight, I might be\Ntearing your throat out with my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Enma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It is indeed, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I had my misgivings, when Lady\NHiyori said she would give Enma to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a reason I couldn't stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That sword he took.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If it truly is Shusui?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You should return it to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it's my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was handed down to\Nme From my late father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that be a fair trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can give\Nme a replacement, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's strange because\Nhe's a pirate from a foreign land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I look at him, I can't help\Nbut see the young dime-mule of Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimotuki Ushimaru, fighting with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, even their swordplay is similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Ushimaru descended from the\NGod of the Blade Shimotsuki Ryuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that Zorojuro returned Shusui\Nto the land of Wano feels like fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even a one-eyed\NSamurai, just like Riyuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this is the end of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see the moon, so your\NSulong form won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, King of the Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgive you by lying about\Nthe samurai you're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You already paid the\Nprice with your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance\Nto bring rice home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, your leg is coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that I don't\Nknow anyone named Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's here, I'll cut my own belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You are born.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We would have laid down our lives\Na hundred times to protect Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our honor demanded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have been too ashamed\Nto return if I had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those your last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm cutting off your head this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been preparing for this battle\Never since the day Lord Odin died!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll avenge our fallen\Nlord and save Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For two decades we've\Nasked ourselves, are we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,still lord odin samurai\Nhere is the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough what no how did
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you transform again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it there's a hole in the ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never defile the name\Nof Kozuki Odin ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to reach the final\Nbattle, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If an ancient city must fall\Nfor us to win, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If we must sacrifice our lives\Nto win, then we are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our victory will bring\Na new dawn to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These enemies just keep\Npouring out of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle taking place here\Nis far beyond men like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our base.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You get out of our way or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you boys want to stay\Nalive, I suggest you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Coronado.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Karoo. It's Mr. Catviper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you, Karoo, leaving\Na piece of this bastard for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Pedro, Luffy and his\Nallies never would have made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This raid would have failed before\Nit even had a chance to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You really, Lickety, loved\Nthat bastard, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on my old friend, I can't\Nhelp but gaze at that beautiful full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give Yugara a show, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a drink or two and enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to the sky, you slobbering Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The view of tonight's full\Nmoon shall be your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a fool\Nfor serving the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but on second thought\Nserving that breath is even.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Use is nothing to laugh at!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:16:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a scoundrel who grew up to be a\Nsamurai, so our lord can grow as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mono will watch over him, as\Nhe will watch over us someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you will not look to see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow-pone-jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With the strength and dedication of\Nmy ninpo, I shall defeat my enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that thing a giant dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who invited a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be Kaido. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count me out. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:16:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never make a snack out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try, I will swallow you whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please step away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you're ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.66,0:17:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Kaido, is it here? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.56,0:17:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I used my right hand\Njutsu on Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to do it, but he begged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So I turned him into a\N28-year-old at his request.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power can really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You look just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking back Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Crock, Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they collapse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy can use Kakarazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Krieg, that's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fate of all who dare to bask
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,in my presence before\Nstealing their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I did take down two Tobiropo after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you might as well call\Nme Sibling Hunter Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tobiropo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't defy my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Join me by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why all the bad guys are\Npassing out, but it sure is handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because Big Mom is fighting\Non the same floor as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the strong are able to withstand\Nthe power of her conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, do you know\Nwhat happened to Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.02,0:19:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think what Momo said earlier\Nis all that matters, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear his voice now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:20:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And he promised me that he'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Momo is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu was with him, but\NI can't reach her either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what they say,\Nno news is good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you are not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When you finish your\Njob, hustle on down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy troops are pouring into the\Nperformance floor all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure could use a hand. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The performance floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your ground, bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let a single one of them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Sanji are fighting two\Nof the lead performers in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and they can't afford to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, but that doesn't\Nmean I take orders from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're eight boxes! Don't forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop burning me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it would make\Nsense to cremate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not ready for that yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have the best to protect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Ferran Corpse! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The short of it is we need to\Nget out of the castle quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do any of you minks know\Nhow the raid is progressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All I've seen out there is chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, on the way here, I\Nran into Jinbe on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Heribus Brickfield!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard any news in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your captain still battling\Nagainst Kaido on the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:21:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been too busy fighting to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.86,0:22:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get bogged down like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find the strong\Nopponents and focus on them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, help! It's me, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a fire down here on the\Nthird floor, and it's spreading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get downstairs,\Nthen you'd better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good, but wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the roof, who's keeping\NKaido busy up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, you're never gonna become Oda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:23:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I listen to\Nthe man who wants me dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.30,0:23:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a family quarrel\Nand it isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take the name of Odin,\Nyou must be prepared for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I should be\Npunished for admiring someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.04,0:23:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Odin, but you can't\Ntake that away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.16,0:23:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,BALLS, I 'LL PROTECT THE\NLAND OF WADO, OUT OF MY WAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,NOW ALL THEN THE PORTERS OF WADO ARE Tang!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Was she always this violent?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.18,0:23:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but she's been terrorizing\Nus like this all week!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.16,0:23:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She may be Commander Kaido's\Ndaughter, but she's still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way she can\Ntake us all on at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge in and stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, just come quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.98,0:24:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.12,0:24:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.58,0:24:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,RUNNING!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.30,0:24:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't even touch him, did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:25:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one responsible\Nfor all this? Yamato? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Odin, not Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.70,0:25:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer my question, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who did this to my men?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.74,0:25:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They just collapsed on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.92,0:25:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.83,0:25:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get these chains off of me, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.60,0:25:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't feed me, I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.64,0:25:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki, interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.86,0:25:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you've decided you\Nwant to be Odin, then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.18,0:25:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you cool your\Nhead in here for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.66,0:25:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A month ought to do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.60,0:25:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me in here! It's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.12,0:26:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole month, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.12,0:26:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ogre Princess is tough, but\Nthere's no way she can survive that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.56,0:26:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, there are samurai from the\Nland of Wano locked up in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.14,0:26:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're as dangerous as they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.44,0:26:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you the same\Nmercy as my idiot child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.02,0:26:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one month to get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you change your mind, shout\Nthrough the air hole in the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.18,0:26:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them you want to join my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.36,0:26:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll let you out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.32,0:26:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How many days has it been\Nsince you ate something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.24,0:26:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Or one of you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.66,0:26:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Swordsmen should not be\Nwithout their swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.36,0:26:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I know. You're my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.14,0:26:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.54,0:26:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.00,0:26:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't give them their swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.92,0:26:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.74,0:26:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, why would they want to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.26,0:27:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you were Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.92,0:27:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm Odin, I'm also the\Nson of Kaido, who killed Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.14,0:27:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be too easy for those\Nsamurai to take their revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.06,0:27:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Father only put that food there\Nso we would fight over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.66,0:27:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.50,0:27:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no point in\Nme thinking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.20,0:27:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to kill me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.66,0:27:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.02,0:27:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.20,0:27:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.74,0:28:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.94,0:28:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of I don't get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.72,0:28:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.12,0:28:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'll eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.80,0:28:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really hungry, so I'll eat the\Nwhole thing if you don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.26,0:28:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.62,0:28:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's sins are not your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.52,0:28:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.38,0:28:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your jam and I are so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.36,0:28:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you don't get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.76,0:29:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I become a samurai,\Neven though I get hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.04,0:29:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.58,0:29:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.12,0:29:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.76,0:29:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that you're Kozuki Odin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.58,0:29:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We overheard your talk, and I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.66,0:29:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We love Odin as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.58,0:29:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What name does a fallen Samurai need?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.90,0:30:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call me so-and-so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.94,0:30:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I found too many hard words. You
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.10,0:30:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,had Odin's travel log all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.96,0:30:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This world has four seas as well\Nas one long and narrow waterway.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.06,0:30:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently he says the planet's\Nround just like a dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mysterious thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.88,0:30:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.08,0:30:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I already lost count.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.00,0:30:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all starting to blur together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is too cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.18,0:30:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he would let\Nhis own child die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.06,0:30:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.50,0:30:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear we may not live long enough to\Nsee the battle that Odin predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.56,0:30:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll happen, and when it does,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight on the side\Nof Wano and its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.48,0:30:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go out to see like Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.12,0:31:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.82,0:31:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I won't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.16,0:31:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Our path is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.68,0:31:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead or alive, there's an important\Nrole for us to play in that war.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.74,0:31:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure that you won't die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.14,0:31:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,20 years is a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.34,0:31:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Too long for us to wait. I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.34,0:31:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wives, you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.06,0:31:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My father is going to kill you for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stay here and\Nspend my final days rotting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.76,0:31:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We never intended to give in to Kaido
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.78,0:31:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.86,0:31:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave the land of Wano to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.30,0:32:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you, because\Nthere are people who believe in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.60,0:32:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,who accept me for who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.90,0:32:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to take away the\Nfreedom of one of those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.38,0:32:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To take away my freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.34,0:32:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is more than just a series of\Nquestions and answers, you ignorant brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.26,0:32:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,WONDERPOWER!
